
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "View";
}
<h2 class="section-title">
    <span class="section-icon">🌸</span>
    About LEORÉ
</h2>
<p class="lead">
    Where Elegance Meets Effortless Shopping
</p>
</section>

<section class="content-card">
    <h2 class="section-title">
        <span class="section-icon heart">♥</span>
        The Core Message
    </h2>
    <blockquote class="quote">
        “LEORÉ: Where Femininity is Embodied in Every Detail.”
    </blockquote>
</section>

<section class="content-card">
    <h2 class="section-heading">Our Mission And Vision</h2>

    <div class="bullet-group">
        <h3 class="bullet-title">The Definition</h3>
        <p>
            “LEORÉ is your ultimate destination for exquisite online shopping,
            meticulously designed to offer you a curated collection of
            <strong>Accessories, Perfumes, Makeup, and Scarves</strong> that
            effortlessly complete your beauty and elegance.”
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bullet-group">
        <h3 class="bullet-title">The Goal</h3>
        <p>
            “Our mission is to ensure your shopping experience is unforgettable,
            allowing you to find everything you need for a soft, integrated
            look in one place, all while reflecting your refined taste.”
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="content-card">
    <h2 class="section-heading">What Sets LEORÉ Apart</h2>

    <ul class="feature-list">
        <li class="feature-item">
            <span class="feature-icon">🎀</span>
            <div>
                <h3 class="feature-title">Carefully Curated Selection</h3>
                <p>
                    “We believe that elegance should be effortless. The LEORÉ team
                    hand-selects every piece with utmost care, guaranteeing that
                    every accessory, perfume, or scarf adds a touch of lasting
                    luxury to your look.”
                </p>
            </div>
        </li>

        <li class="feature-item">
            <span class="feature-icon">🎀</span>
            <div>
                <h3 class="feature-title">A Seamless, Feminine Experience</h3>
                <p>
                    “Our website is crafted to be your private shopping sanctuary,
                    with a tranquil design and feminine colors, so you can shop with
                    comfort and ease.”
                </p>
            </div>
        </li>

        <li class="feature-item">
            <span class="feature-icon">🎀</span>
            <div>
                <h3 class="feature-title">Celebrating Your Beauty</h3>
                <p>
                    “At LEORÉ, we celebrate every facet of femininity and beauty.
                    Our products are here to boost your confidence and make you feel
                    radiant on every occasion.”
                </p>
            </div>
        </li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="content-card">
    <h2 class="section-heading">Our Quality Promise</h2>
    <p>
        “We stand behind the quality of every product that reaches you, from
        the unique blend of our perfumes and the soft texture of our scarves,
        to the delicate designs of our accessories.”
    </p>
